	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02_sppoke1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ふしぎな　けはいが　する……！
あたりを　しらべますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:01:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:01:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>不思議な　気配が　する……！
周囲を　調べますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:01:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:01:26" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント
・d33イベント後にPOSを踏む
　GRIDX＝644、GRIDZ＝585
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→sppoke1_02
　いいえ→終了
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-21T03:20:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>POKE
ポケモン・ユクシー</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T06:58:42" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02_sppoke1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きょううん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:00:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
